Z||000032||GT Bastard||01-22-2001||05:27 PM||||It's got about 103,000 miles on it now.  I haven't driven her in a few weeks, but I know I've put at least 3,000 on it.  Yeah, the funny thing about the rod knock is that it doesn't increase in volume with RPM's...  Wierd.  It certainly doesn't lack power though.  I've considered putting a set of ported manifolds back on... The ones that came off it were re-welded and installed on Angela's Fiero when we had the heads off it. I'm not sure if I'd want to sell the headers though...  They just look too damn cool!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
